					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/james-blue" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2669337); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2669337&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609401592" alt="James Blue" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2669337)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/james-blue" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2669337); return false;" >James Blue</a></span> <span class="odate time_1609400462 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">31 Dec 2020 07:41</span>
