<p><strong>Page type</strong>: New SCP Article<br />
<strong>Elevator Pitch</strong>: This SCP would be something simple, something that makes you wonder &quot;How can a Hot-air balloon do this?&quot;<br />
<strong>Central Narrative</strong>: ISo my SCP is a man in a hot air balloon that is designated safe as he only attacks in self defense. The Hot-Air balloon itself can reach up to extremely fast speeds and stop on a time and do things such as move in any direction or things like barrel rolls. A real physics breaking type entity. For example, the Balloon can easily reach Mach 3 and then stop instantly with no inertia, no drag, nothing and the man in said balloon doesn't fly out of the balloon or do any type of bracing for the oncoming stop. The SCP itself can initiate maneuvers such as barrel rolls.<br />
<strong>Hook</strong>: The hook is that it has that funny/weird feel to it while not being that ridiculous that it takes people of out it.<br />
From what I read I have to get the concept greenlight then the draft and then the final green light for it to become and &quot;Canon&quot; article.<br />
<strong>Additional</strong>: I'm just thinking of how to &quot;Fill&quot; more of so It's not just a few paragraphs.</p>

