<p>I will say that the one thing that gives me pause is the idea of 9 identical sheep that turn into 9 identical music boxes&#8230; one of which the mother gave the son every year&#8230;</p>
<p>These seems overly complicated&#8230; why not just the one sheep? and the one music box? I don't think you'd lose ANYTHING, and it would simplify the story.</p>
<p>Otherwise, I think this seems fairly haunting in a good way. <strong><span style="color: green">GREENLIGHT</span></strong></p>
<p>Good Luck with the drafting</p>

